<title>UK: Bankers Trust sets $200 mln subordinated 3-yr FRN.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets $200 mln subordinated 3-yr FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Bear Stearns.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BT SECURITIES CORP</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +25 B.P.  PAY DATE    24.FEB.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A3	  ISS PRICE  100.039   FULL FEES   0.15</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A-	  REOFFER    100.039</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.05	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES	PAINWEBBER INTERNATIONAL IS JOINT LEAD MANAGER.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
